# WiSiHe monorepo — environment variables
#
# Canonical naming reference: docs/env-variables.md
#
# Each app has its own `.env.local`:
#
#   apps/nextjs-portfolio/.env.local   → main site (Vercel)
#   apps/sanity-studio/.env.local      → Sanity Studio + Algolia scripts
#   apps/wisihe-ai/.env.local          → Sanity App SDK
#
# Local dev:
#   vercel env pull apps/nextjs-portfolio/.env.local --environment=development
#   cp apps/sanity-studio/.env.example apps/sanity-studio/.env.local
#
# With Doppler: see docs/doppler-setup.md
